<Defs>
	<ThingDef ParentName="AnimalThingBase">
		<!-- Alpha Animals AA_Needlepost -> RM_Skorra. Same body substitution as Spineroller (QuadrupedAnimalWithPawsAndTail for AA_SentientPlant, AA_Mouth->Teeth). AA_ToxicSting->Scratch. Dropped: CompProperties_LightSustenance, CompProperties_InitialAbility (venom barb ability) - both VEF.AnimalBehaviours, donor framework. -->
		<defName>RM_Skorra</defName>
		<label>skorra</label>
		<description>A mobile cactus given crude sentience and toxic barbs. Early trials aimed for a stationary deterrent; giving it a body and a mind of its own proved a mistake, and the facility that made the first skorras was overrun soon after. Skorras can draw a little nutrition from rotting vegetation, but they live and die by direct sunlight - a long eclipse is usually fatal.</description>
